OL,3,APolice deployed during stand-off over
OL,4,Acontrol of top Poland court
OL,5,
OL,6,FTusk has vowed to depoliticise the
OL,7,Fjudiciary, and on Friday defended the
OL,8,Fmove as PiS supporters gathered outside
OL,9,Fthe court premises in Warsaw in
OL,10,Fprotest.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
