OL,3,AHundreds evacuated from
OL,4,ARussian-occupied Oleshky during rare
OL,5,AUkraine ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainian authorities confirmed the
OL,8,Fevacuees were on their way to southern
OL,9,FRussia, from where they will travel on
OL,10,Fto Ukraine through Belarus.
OL,12,FMelania Trump said that "all elements
OL,13,Fof the convoy, including the safe
OL,14,Fpassageway in and out of Oleshky, was
OL,15,Festablished through mutual agreement
OL,16,Fbetween Russian and Ukrainian leaders".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
